   "heading": "CATEGORICAL BRAID GROUP ACTIONS AND CACTUS GROUPS 1. Introduction In their seminal work, Chuang and Rouquier introduced sl 2 categoriﬁcations on abelian categories [16]. Their deﬁnition mirrors the notion of an sl 2 representation on a vector space: weight spaces are replaced by weight categories, C",
